    "title": "Woodream Akiya 200",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>A floating pencil bait inspired by sardines called tuba in Sagami Bay.&nbsp;A timeless body, durability as fishing gear, and hidden possibilities.&nbsp;Professional tools may be difficult.&nbsp;However, professional tools can become the ultimate tool depending on the angler, and have the potential to respond to the user’s intentions. </span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>A project started with genuine fish lovers in search of fishing results.&nbsp;When the dna of a fisherman and the soul of an angler are fused, Akiya becomes an evolved lure.&nbsp;We are particular about&nbsp;handmade in japan, just as japanese fishermen individually create original items with their own hands.</span></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length </span>200 mm</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Gr. 97</p></li></ul>",
